---
/**
 * Reviews.astro — "How We Train You" 4-step progressive timeline & interactive journey cards
 */
---

<section id="how-we-train" class="train-section">
  <div class="train-container">
    <!-- Header with pill badge -->
    <div class="train-header">
      <div class="train-pill">
        <span class="train-pill-dot"></span>
        <span>OUR METHODOLOGY</span>
        <span class="train-pill-sep">•</span>
        <span class="font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">सीखने की 4-चरणीय प्रक्रिया</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="train-heading font-['Poppins']">
        How We <span class="train-heading-highlight">Train You</span>
        <span class="train-heading-sub font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">शून्य से विशेषज्ञता तक — आपका सुनियोजित मार्गदर्शक</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="train-lead font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">
        एक संरचित, चरण-दर-चरण रोडमैप जो हर छात्र को बुनियादी समझ से लेकर उद्योग-स्तरीय विशेषज्ञता तक पहुंचाता है।
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-step interactive cards grid -->
    <div class="train-grid">

      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="train-card" style="--card-accent: #0757A8; --card-accent-soft: rgba(7, 87, 168, 0.08);">
        <div class="train-top-row">
          <div class="train-icon-box">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
              <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
              <polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="train-step-badge">STEP 01</div>
        </div>

        <div class="train-body">
          <h3 class="train-step-title font-['Poppins']">
            Enroll
            <span class="train-hindi-title font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">प्रवेश एवं करियर मार्गदर्शन</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="train-label">GET STARTED</span>
          <p class="train-desc font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">
            बिना किसी पूर्व अनुभव के शुरुआत करें। हमारे अनुभवी करियर सलाहकार आपकी रुचि व लक्ष्य के अनुसार सही कोर्स चुनने में व्यक्तिगत मार्गदर्शन प्रदान करते हैं।
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="train-footer">
          <span class="train-feature-tag">🎯 करियर काउंसलिंग</span>
          <span class="train-feature-tag">📋 फ्री डेमो क्लास</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="train-card" style="--card-accent: #D97706; --card-accent-soft: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08);">
        <div class="train-top-row">
          <div class="train-icon-box">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/>
              <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/>
              <line x1="9" y1="7" x2="15" y2="7"/>
              <line x1="9" y1="11" x2="13" y2="11"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="train-step-badge">STEP 02</div>
        </div>

        <div class="train-body">
          <h3 class="train-step-title font-['Poppins']">
            Learn
            <span class="train-hindi-title font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">गहन प्रैक्टिकल लर्निंग</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="train-label">EXPERT TRAINING</span>
          <p class="train-desc font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">
            15+ वर्षों के अनुभवी शिक्षकों से सीखें। 100% व्यक्तिगत ध्यान, दैनिक 1:1 कंप्यूटर लैब सत्र और शंका निवारण के साथ प्रत्येक कॉन्सेप्ट को बारीकी से समझें।
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="train-footer">
          <span class="train-feature-tag">💻 1:1 कंप्यूटर सिस्टम</span>
          <span class="train-feature-tag">👨‍🏫 अनुभवी फैकल्टी</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="train-card" style="--card-accent: #059669; --card-accent-soft: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08);">
        <div class="train-top-row">
          <div class="train-icon-box">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/>
              <line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/>
              <polyline points="7 10 10 13 17 6"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="train-step-badge">STEP 03</div>
        </div>

        <div class="train-body">
          <h3 class="train-step-title font-['Poppins']">
            Practice
            <span class="train-hindi-title font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">लाइव प्रोजेक्ट्स व असाइनमेंट्स</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="train-label">REAL PROJECTS</span>
          <p class="train-desc font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">
            सिद्धांत से आगे बढ़कर वास्तविक दुनिया के प्रोजेक्ट्स, जीएसटी इनवॉइसिंग, वेबसाइट कोडिंग और मॉक टेस्ट्स हल करें ताकि आत्मविश्वास चरम पर हो।
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="train-footer">
          <span class="train-feature-tag">🚀 लाइव असाइनमेंट्स</span>
          <span class="train-feature-tag">📝 मॉक टेस्ट सीरीज</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 4 -->
      <div class="train-card" style="--card-accent: #7C3AED; --card-accent-soft: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.08);">
        <div class="train-top-row">
          <div class="train-icon-box">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="7"/>
              <polyline points="8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="train-step-badge">STEP 04</div>
        </div>

        <div class="train-body">
          <h3 class="train-step-title font-['Poppins']">
            Succeed
            <span class="train-hindi-title font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">सर्टिफिकेशन व 100% प्लेसमेंट</span>
          </h3>
          <span class="train-label">CAREER LAUNCH</span>
          <p class="train-desc font-['Noto_Sans_Devanagari']">
            राजस्थान सरकार व मान्यता प्राप्त प्रामाणिक सर्टिफिकेट प्राप्त करें। बायोडाटा निर्माण, इंटरव्यू की तैयारी और सक्रिय प्लेसमेंट सपोर्ट के साथ करियर की शुरुआत करें।
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="train-footer">
          <span class="train-feature-tag">🏆 सरकारी प्रमाण पत्र</span>
          <span class="train-feature-tag">💼 100% जॉब सहायता</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .train-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #F4F8FC 60%, #EBF2F9 100%);
    padding: 72px 20px 84px;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid #E5EDF6;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .train-container {
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Header */
  .train-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 52px;
  }

  .train-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #DFE7F2;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(7, 54, 108, 0.05);
    color: #07366C;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .train-pill-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #F39A18;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(243, 154, 24, 0.2);
  }

  .train-pill-sep {
    color: #F39A18;
  }

  .train-heading {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #07366C;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .train-heading-highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0757A8 0%, #D97706 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .train-heading-sub {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 19px);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #D88B08;
    margin-top: 6px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .train-lead {
    color: #4A5B73;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Grid */
  .train-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Card */
  .train-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E1EAF4;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 28px 24px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(7, 54, 108, 0.05);
    transition: all 0.32s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .train-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 0 0 4px 4px;
    background: var(--card-accent);
    opacity: 0.8;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .train-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: rgba(7, 87, 168, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(7, 54, 108, 0.12);
  }

  .train-card:hover::before {
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Top Row */
  .train-top-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .train-icon-box {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--card-accent-soft);
    color: var(--card-accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .train-card:hover .train-icon-box {
    transform: scale(1.08) rotate(3deg);
  }

  .train-step-badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--card-accent);
    background: var(--card-accent-soft);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  /* Body */
  .train-body {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .train-step-title {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #07366C;
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .train-hindi-title {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--card-accent);
    margin-top: 4px;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .train-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #8C9BAE;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 8px 0 14px;
  }

  .train-desc {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #4B5B6E;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* Footer Tags */
  .train-footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px dashed #E5ECF4;
  }

  .train-feature-tag {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #2F3E50;
    background: #F4F7FB;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #E8EEF5;
  }

  /* Responsiveness */
  @media (max-width: 1080px) {
    .train-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .train-section {
      padding: 56px 16px 64px;
    }

    .train-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .train-card {
      padding: 22px 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
